{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34807","headline":"重阳日访元秀上人 · 司空图","name":"重阳日访元秀上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"红叶黄花秋景宽，醉吟朝夕在樊川。\n却嫌今日登山俗，且共高僧对榻眠。\n别画长怀吴寺壁，宜茶偏赏霅溪泉。\n归来童穉争相笑，何事无人与酒船。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司空图","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34807.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34807","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}